   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Family Happiness**: back after 258 archived shows (4850 days); rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat & Tuning**: back after 136 archived shows (1827 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Running Away With What Freud Said**: back after 66 archived shows (671 days); rare: 9 archived performances [2]\n- **Golden Boy**: rare: 7 archived performances [2]\n- **Going To Palestine**: rare: 10 archived performances [2]\n- **Chat & Tuning**: back after 136 archived shows (1827 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n- **Alpha Incipiens**: back after 96 archived shows (1035 days) [2]\n- **Chat**: back after 136 archived shows (1827 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **tmg2024-07-24.SP_CMC_8.24bit** (recommended): source not stated; 23 songs; 60 min [1]. Said about its sound: A hum runs through the recording, mostly in the right channel, probably from an air conditioner [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **tmg2024-07-24.SP_CMC_8.24bit**: taped by ManOfStealth; transferred by Dennis Orr; source: SP-CMC-8 (cardioids) > SP-SPSB-10 battery box > Sony PCM-M10 @ 24 bit/48 kHz [1]. Also: Mastering involved iZotope RX11 de-click, Sound Forge edits, normalizing, fades, and tilt EQ, then CDWav tracking and FLAC encoding [1]",
